    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sunrider series returns in a new fantasy universe! Both new and returning players can embark on this adventure on the high seas. Become a naval captain in the age of sail and command your fleet in tactical turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Naval Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just because the girls look cute doesn\u2019t mean the battles will be simple! Equip your ships with different weapons like chain shots to maximize their stats. Raise or lower your sails to use the wind to move optimally. And if that isn\u2019t enough, turn the tide of battle by firing the Vanguard Cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Boarding</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can board enemy ships in this game! Assemble boarding parties for each ship under your command. A powerful enemy ship causing you trouble? Capture it and add it to your fleet! Any enemy ship can be captured \u2013 and we mean ANY! Collect loot from enemy ships to add new powerful weapons to your ships. And what\u2019s this? You can loot cooking ingredients to craft bread in Chigara\u2019s Bakery?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions can change the direction of the story! Discover secret storylines and recruit powerful bonus characters to your party! Even if you complete the game once, your story is not yet over. In New Game+, you can explore alternate story paths, find new recruitable girls, and collect extra powerful loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Affection System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sunrider 4 Affection System returns! Chat with the girls to gain affection points that unlock powerful new abilities! But it\u2019s not just gameplay bonuses \u2013 Sunrider Legends has 14 unique ending scenes, one for each recruitable girl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the girls on the high seas in this tactical turn-based naval RPG!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters and Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/a2459fc7abda403106201c59707a802c.avif?t=1754075168\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/15814b5a9105d6336381dfba1dff8d03.avif?t=1754075168\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/c9ba68e711b15754fc4079217a4d46ca.avif?t=1754075168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/2721a903123034c82a365a4d51bdb1fd.avif?t=1754075168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/d7907369ebbf4575dacb8c4c9ca7e884.avif?t=1754075168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/162ac39d01e0fd147f750928e1d3e0aa.avif?t=1754075168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/9e1adae33aabd1fc239e51096cb6c58b.avif?t=1754075168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/f84880712f23040b1bf23ae3e1d20b01.avif?t=1754075168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sunrider series returns in a new fantasy universe! Both new and returning players can embark on this adventure on the high seas. Become a naval captain in the age of sail and command your fleet in tactical turn-based battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Naval Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just because the girls look cute doesn\u2019t mean the battles will be simple! Equip your ships with different weapons like chain shots to maximize their stats. Raise or lower your sails to use the wind to move optimally. And if that isn\u2019t enough, turn the tide of battle by firing the Vanguard Cannon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Boarding</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, you can board enemy ships in this game! Assemble boarding parties for each ship under your command. A powerful enemy ship causing you trouble? Capture it and add it to your fleet! Any enemy ship can be captured \u2013 and we mean ANY! Collect loot from enemy ships to add new powerful weapons to your ships. And what\u2019s this? You can loot cooking ingredients to craft bread in Chigara\u2019s Bakery?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Own Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your actions can change the direction of the story! Discover secret storylines and recruit powerful bonus characters to your party! Even if you complete the game once, your story is not yet over. In New Game+, you can explore alternate story paths, find new recruitable girls, and collect extra powerful loot!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Affection System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sunrider 4 Affection System returns! Chat with the girls to gain affection points that unlock powerful new abilities! But it\u2019s not just gameplay bonuses \u2013 Sunrider Legends has 14 unique ending scenes, one for each recruitable girl!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the girls on the high seas in this tactical turn-based naval RPG!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters and Units</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/a2459fc7abda403106201c59707a802c.avif?t=1754075168\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/15814b5a9105d6336381dfba1dff8d03.avif?t=1754075168\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/c9ba68e711b15754fc4079217a4d46ca.avif?t=1754075168\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/2721a903123034c82a365a4d51bdb1fd.avif?t=1754075168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/d7907369ebbf4575dacb8c4c9ca7e884.avif?t=1754075168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/162ac39d01e0fd147f750928e1d3e0aa.avif?t=1754075168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854880/extras/9e1adae33aabd1fc239e51096cb6c58b.avif?t=1754075168\" width=1600 height=900 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=